    {
      "id": "1999-dii:R0003",
      "text": "In the fixed (static) mode of operation (base or data processing megacenter), the data management services shall have the capability of being tuned by on-site personnel to adjust for varying workloads and sizes of associated databases. These workloads and databases are expected to change more frequently and to a greater extent than for processing associated with deployed units",
      "class": "FR",
      "subtype": null,
      "subtype_name": null,
      "promise_subtype": null,
      "tier": "primary",
      "label_source": "section",
      "confidence": 0.85,
